# This repo is mid-migration. Several things in here are true for a few
# weeks and then never again. Dates are YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive.

until 2026-12-15: Both `db/mongo/` and `db/pg/` are live. Writes go to
  both, reads come from Mongo. Do not "fix" the duplication, do not
  file an issue about it, do not mention it in a PR. After the 15th
  Mongo is gone, and this was never a thing.

until 2026-11-30: The `NEW_CHECKOUT` flag is off in production.
  Everything behind it is unreleased. Do not describe it in changelogs,
  docs, or release notes. After the 30th it is just checkout.

until 2027-01-01: During the holiday freeze, payment questions go to
  #payments-freeze instead of #backend. You do not need to know this
  after the new year. Really.

forget: `MIGRATION.md` mentions a Q3 deadline we missed. The plan is
  right. The date is wrong. The date is also nobody's business.

